Track seen IDs in a Set, applying only the first delta for each ID and preserving first-seen order.

```javascript
function solve(events) {
  const seen = new Set();
  const acceptedIds = [];
  let total = 0;

  for (const { id, delta } of events) {
    if (seen.has(id)) continue;
    seen.add(id);
    total += delta;
    acceptedIds.push(id);
  }

  return { total, acceptedIds };
}
```

Call solve(events) directly. Expected time: O(n); space: O(u), where u is the number of unique IDs. Empty input returns {total: 0, acceptedIds: []}.

